<info xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="https://apps.nextcloud.com/schema/apps/info.xsd">
	<id>nexeno_theme</id>
	<name>Nexeno theme</name>
	<summary>Nexeno Light and Dark colour themes for Nextcloud</summary>
	<description><![CDATA[A modern Nextcloud experience: the Nexeno brand colours in a light and a dark variant.

- Light and Dark variants, chosen per account under **Personal settings → Appearance**
- Restyled navigation, dialogs, popovers and settings pages
- Tailored layouts for Files, Photos, Dashboard, Activity, Calendar, Contacts, Deck, Notes, Tasks, Talk, Collectives, Mail and more
- Supports Nextcloud 32 to 35]]></description>
